---
import ContactLinks from './ContactLinks.astro';
import Portrait from './Portrait.astro';
---
<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="hero-kicker">Enterprise AI, data, and workflow delivery</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">Enterprise operator for AI and workflow initiatives that need trust, structure, and forward motion.</h1>
    <p class="hero-subline">AI access on its own does not create business capacity. I help teams turn fragmented AI, data, and knowledge work into scoped delivery tracks people can validate, run, and improve without constant rework.</p>
    <p class="hero-support">Best fit when budget, stakeholders, and urgency already exist, but gains still are not showing up in throughput, ownership, or trust.</p>
    <ContactLinks />
  </div>
  <aside class="hero-rail" aria-label="Credibility rail">
    <div class="hero-proof">
      <p class="hero-proof-label">Selected proof</p>
      <h2>Built in live robotics deployments, research-heavy evidence pipelines, and enterprise AI delivery.</h2>
      <ul class="hero-proof-list">
        <li>Amazon Robotics deployment work in operating environments</li>
        <li>DLR evidence pipelines for experimental systems</li>
        <li>Enterprise AI delivery for financial and industrial clients</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <Portrait />
  </aside>
</section>
